  "class_provenance_warning": "These are recorded here from the fan wikis, but nobody has yet opened the\n    VGO Emulator client and confirmed them. They may be exactly right, they may\n    carry figures the game never used, or they may not be in the emulator at\n    all — there is no way to tell from the sources alone.\n    \n      Of this class's 166 abilities,\n      115 have had their tooltip read in game.\n    \n    Where a tooltip has been read it overrides the wikis, and around four in\n    five disagreed with them — so treat the figures below with care.",
