      "class_row_html": "<tr>\n<td class=\"num\">36</td>\n<td>\n<img alt=\"\" height=\"22\" src=\"/static/icons/thundering-fists-ii.png\" style=\"vertical-align:-5px;margin-right:6px\" width=\"22\"/>\n<a href=\"/abilities/thundering-fists-ii\">Thundering Fists II</a>\n<br/><span class=\"muted\">(Drunken Dicipline)</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"muted\"></td>\n<td class=\"num muted\">\n              10\n            </td>\n<td class=\"muted\">Instant</td>\n<td class=\"num muted\">5</td>\n<td class=\"muted\">You pound your opponent with mighty strikes, hitting 3 times for melee damage plus 118. Only available after executing...</td>\n</tr>",
      "detail_url": "https://vgsoharchive.com/abilities/thundering-fists-ii",
      "detail_cache": {
        "path": ".cache/archive/52c68afd34b3d192d8ce382faa30afa04661a4b8c94edcd6875188a583a1b7c9.txt",
        "sha256": "e8a1eee147a8d6c41d9bc0446b41b7ad44fa1210431e35d49c41c38ced9c8c00"
      },
      "detail_main_html": "<main class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"detail-head\">\n<h1>\n<img alt=\"\" height=\"40\" src=\"/static/icons/thundering-fists-ii.png\" style=\"vertical-align:-8px;margin-right:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\" width=\"40\"/>\n    \n    Thundering Fists II\n  </h1>\n<p class=\"muted\">\n<a href=\"/classes/monk\">Monk</a>\n    \n    · Level 36\n    \n    · (Drunken Dicipline)\n  </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cols\">\n<div>\n<h2>Effect</h2>\n<div class=\"tooltip\">You pound your opponent with mighty strikes, hitting 3 times for melee damage plus 118. Only available after executing Thousand Fists. Increases Jin by 1.</div>\n<h2>As it was earlier</h2>\n<p class=\"muted small\">\n        What guides written while Vanguard was running recorded for this\n        ability. Kept beside the current figures rather than replacing them\n        — the game was rebalanced across its life, so both are right for\n        their own year.\n      </p>\n<dl class=\"facts\">\n<div><dt>Level in 2007</dt>\n<dd>36</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Energy then</dt>\n<dd>27</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Cast then</dt><dd>Instant</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Refresh then</dt><dd>60</dd></div>\n</dl>\n<div class=\"tooltip\">You pound your opponent with mighty strikes, hitting 3 times for 149 to 161 damage Increases Jin by 1</div>\n<p class=\"muted small\">\n<a href=\"http://www.vanguardmonks.com:80/index.php?option=com_monkabilities&amp;Itemid=56&amp;ability=Thundering+Fists+II\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">vanguardmonks.com</a>,\n          \n          2007 ·\n          <a href=\"/abilities/as-it-was\">every ability that changed</a>\n</p>\n<h2>Notes</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">Previously recorded by The Telon Project as: “You pound your opponent with mighty strikes, hitting 3 times for melee damage plus 118. Only available executing Thousand Fists. Increases Jin by 1” (http://thetelonproject.wikidot.com/abilities:thundering-fists-ii)</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Read from the in-game tooltip in VGO Emulator. Bracketed damage figures shown in game are the skill- and level-adjusted values for that character and are not recorded here.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2>Details</h2>\n<dl class=\"kv\">\n<div><dt>Level</dt><dd>36</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Endurance cost</dt><dd>10</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Cast time</dt><dd>Instant</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Refresh</dt><dd>1:30s</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Range</dt><dd>5m</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Target</dt><dd>Offensive Target</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Requires</dt><dd>Thousand Fists</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Drunken Discipline</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Learned from</dt><dd>Class Trainers</dd></div>\n</dl>\n<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul class=\"plain\">\n<li><strong>Verified from the in-game tooltip</strong>\n<span class=\"muted\">— these figures override the wikis</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://thetelonproject.wikidot.com/abilities:thundering-fists-ii\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">The Telon Project</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top:26px\"><a href=\"/abilities\">← All abilities</a></p>\n</main>",
      "current_effect_html": "<div class=\"tooltip\">You pound your opponent with mighty strikes, hitting 3 times for melee damage plus 118. Only available after executing Thousand Fists. Increases Jin by 1.</div>",
